<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW PLANS 1996 PAYOUT.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW PLANS 1996 PAYOUT.</headline>
<dateline>KRAKOW, Poland 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The management of Polish construction company  Mostostal Krakow plans to earmark between 25 and 30 percent of 1996 net profit for dividend, the president of the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The management confirms...the willingness to propose the general shareholders meeting to pay 1996 dividend and plans to earmark 25 to 30 percent of net profit for that purpose,&quot; Stanislaw Osieka told reporters.</p>
<p>He added that Mostostal Krakow earned net an estimated 4.6 million zlotys in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Wojciech Zurawski +48 22 653 9700</p>
